653	/* --------------------------------------------------------
654	 * PUT_VAR test: PUT_CONST A0 bob, PUT_VAR X0 A1, HALT
655	 *
656	 * Expected: A0 = atom(bob) = 4194305
657	 *           A1 = REF(536)  = 536 (self-ref, TAG_REF=0)
658	 *           HP = 537 (one cell allocated)
659	 *           MEM(536) = 536 (self-referencing REF on heap)
