945	    /* Test 6: Trail push and unwind
946	     * Create two vars, bind both, verify bound, unwind, verify unbound.
947	     *
948	     * Expected:
949	     *   TR before bind = 4632 (TRAIL_BASE)
950	     *   After 2 binds: TR = 4634, both deref to atoms
